    [4854]={name="Demon Scarred Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=6,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Ghost Howl.",zone="Thunder Bluff",npc="Ghost Howl"},
    [4915]={name="Soft Wool Boots",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cutting Teeth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gornek in Durotar. Objective: Kill 10 Mottled Boars then return to Gornek at the Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Cutting Teeth",lore="The first order of business will be to put a little strength in your backbone. I could send you out to the Barrens to hunt kodo, but well, in all honesty, you're more useful to us alive than dead."},
    [4916]={name="Soft Wool Vest",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sarkoth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Hana'zua in Durotar. Objective: Kill Sarkoth and bring his claw back to Hana'zua.",zone="Durotar",questName="Sarkoth",lore="Seeing the deed you have done for me steels my heart. I cannot fall so easily! I must endure! But it remains that I cannot make the trek back to the Den unassisted."},
    [4919]={name="Soft Wool Belt",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sting of the Scorpid'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gornek in Durotar. Objective: Get 10 Scorpid Worker Tails for Gornek in the Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Sting of the Scorpid",lore="Powerful warrior and awkward novice alike have fallen to the venomous sting of the scorpid. You will find large numbers of scorpids northwest of here."},
    [4920]={name="Battleworn Cape",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sting of the Scorpid'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gornek in Durotar. Objective: Get 10 Scorpid Worker Tails for Gornek in the Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Sting of the Scorpid",lore="Powerful warrior and awkward novice alike have fallen to the venomous sting of the scorpid. You will find large numbers of scorpids northwest of here."},
    [4933]={name="Seasoned Fighter's Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=9,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Thwarting Kolkar Aggression'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Lar Prowltusk in Durotar. Objective: Lar Prowltusk outside of Sen'jin Village wants you to destroy the 3 sets of Attack Plans held within Kolkar Crag.",zone="Durotar",questName="Thwarting Kolkar Aggression",lore="Lower your voice. The Kolkar centaurs lie just over the ridge to the west in Kolkar Crag."},
    [4936]={name="Dirt-trodden Boots",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=3,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'From The Wreckage....'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gar'Thok in Durotar. Objective: Gar'Thok of Razor Hill wants you to retrieve 3 Gnomish Tools from the wreckage off the coast.",zone="Durotar",questName="From The Wreckage....",lore="One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."},
    [4944]={name="Handsewn Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Lost But Not Forgotten'. Starts with Misha Tor'kren in Durotar. Objective: Bring a sign of Kron's fate to Misha Tor'kren at the farmstead northwest of Razor Hill.",zone="Durotar",questName="Lost But Not Forgotten",lore="please, can you help me? My son Kron went hunting days ago, and he still hasn't returned. He went west towards the Barrens to hunt crocolisks along Southfury River."},
    [4958]={name="Sun-beaten Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=3,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rite of Vision'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zarlman Two-Moons in Mulgore. Objective: Consume the Water of the Seers in front of the tribal fire in Bloodhoof Village and follow the vision once it appears. Provided item:.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Rite of Vision",lore="I now present you with the Water of the Seers. When you are ready, consume the waters near the tribal fire. Once you have ingested the holy waters, it will take a few moments before the vision materializes before the fire."},
    [5069]={name="Fire Wand",quality=2,ilvl=12,reqLevel=7,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 6-14.",zone="The Barrens"},
    [5071]={name="Shadow Wand",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 9-15.",zone="The Barrens"},
    [5242]={name="Cinder Wand",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arugal's Folly'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Dalar Dawnweaver in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Bring 6 Worgen Bits to Dalar Dawnweaver in The Sepulcher.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Arugal's Folly",lore="As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool. I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy."},
    [5337]={name="Wayfaring Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stolen Booty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gazlowe in The Barrens. Objective: Retrieve the Shipment of Boots and Telescopic Lens for Gazlowe in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Stolen Booty",lore="While I'd like to recover all my goods, I'm sure that's not possible. Still, there's a few things that I absolutely must have! As you see, my observatory is ready to go, but it needs the smaller of the two lenses."},
    [5405]={name="Draped Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Balance of Nature'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Conservator Ilthalaine in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill 7 Young Nightsabers and 4 Young Thistle Boars and return to Conservator Ilthalaine.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Balance of Nature",lore="Thinning the younger population of creatures here in Shadowglen was a good start, but there is still work to be done. The resources of the forest will be depleted too quickly if the problem is not addressed."},
    [5420]={name="Banshee Armor",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Demon Seed'. Starts with Ak'Zeloth in The Barrens. Objective: Grab a Flawed Power Stone. Bring it to the Altar of Fire before the stone expires, then return to Ak'Zeloth.",zone="Durotar",questName="The Demon Seed",lore="The Demon Seed is a powerful tool for the Burning Legion. It rests in a cave on Dreadmist Peak, above a demonic altar of fire. I have prepared power stones that when placed near the Seed will disrupt its connection to the Legion."},
    [5458]={name="Dirtwood Belt",quality=1,ilvl=10,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Oakenscowl'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Denalan in Teldrassil. Objective: Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth wants you to collect the Gargantuan Tumor from Oakenscowl.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Oakenscowl",lore="In a cave along the southern bank of the lake, a timberling named Oakenscowl is spreading corruption to all the creatures that make Lake Al'Ameth their home."},
    [5590]={name="Cord Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mist'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Teldrassil. Objective: Escort Mist to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak at the moon well near the Oracle Tree.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Mist",lore="The sabercat's fur is a distinctive gray color, blending into the surrounding forest. As she lays there, you observe that she is badly wounded, with deep lacerations across her back and stomach."},
    [5591]={name="Rain-spotted Cape",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=6,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Enchanted Glade'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in Teldrassil. Objective: Acquire 6 Bloodfeather Belts and bring them to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in the Oracle Glade.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Enchanted Glade",lore="I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."},
    [5604]={name="Elven Wand",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bashal'Aran'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Asterion in Darkshore. Objective: Destroy the Ancient Moonstone Seal at the ancient flame in Ameth'Aran, then return to Asterion in Bashal'Aran.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [5606]={name="Gardening Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=9,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timberling Sprouts'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Denalan in Teldrassil. Objective: Bring 12 Timberling Sprouts to Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Timberling Sprouts",lore="Small timberlings are sprouting around the waters of Lake Al'Ameth. I'm afraid these sprouts are beyond help -- we should try to clear them from the land before they grow large enough to cause trouble."},
    [5744]={name="Pale Skinner",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Fedfennel.",zone="Elwynn Forest",npc="Fedfennel"},
